// Ported from the 377 revision. Deliberately minimal: this exists to prove the npc + model asset
// path, not to be a working Barrows brother. op2=Attack is omitted because there are no combat
// stats or scripts behind it, so it would only offer a broken interaction.
[barrows_karil]
name=Karil the Tainted
desc=A vengeful spirit corrupted by dark magic.
